# E-Commerce Return & Refund Analysis

## Project Overview
Analyzed e-commerce order, return, and refund data to identify key factors contributing to product returns and refund requests.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- SQL
- Power BI
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Project Workflow
- Data Cleaning
- Data Preprocessing
- Exploratory Data Analysis
- SQL Analysis
- Dashboard Development

## Key Insights
- Identified products and categories with the highest return rates.
- Analyzed return behavior across regions and customer segments.
- Evaluated refund trends and their impact on business performance.
- Developed an interactive dashboard for return and refund monitoring.

